flowchart LR
    DB[Application PostgreSQL] --> Backup[Daily backup]
    Git[Git + Gitea config] --> Backup
    Keys[Keys + config] --> Backup
    Backup --> Store[Off-server backup]
    Store --> Restore[Clean-node restore]
    Restore --> Verify{Restore verified?}
    Verify -->|Yes| Ready([Verify sign-in → PDF])
    Verify -->|No| Fix[Fix procedure and retry]
    Fix --> Restore
    Restart[Controller restart] --> Leases[Find expired leases]
    Leases --> Retry[Retry with same SHA]
    Retry --> Fencing[One publication and one charge]
    Restart --> Cleanup[Clean orphan files + pins]
